direction_1180 = location "Harpy" about "Harpy\nHarpies have low intelligence and attacks just about anyone coming into their territories. When they meet up with other harpie groups of the mountainous area they have battles without a reason. " found "Karus Eslant" karus at 432 493 in zone 11
direction_1181 = location "Harpy" about "Harpy\nHarpies have low intelligence and attacks just about anyone coming into their territories. When they meet up with other harpie groups of the mountainous area they have battles without a reason. " found "El Morad Eslant" elmorad at 420 499 in zone 12

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo might know the answer. Try talking to him again."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, [Eslant Wise Man]Agata might know the answer. Try talking to him again."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You want to know the identity of the monster? Then I will need some more time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "For now go kill some [Harpys], they are so loud that its hard for me to concentrate.\n\nDefeat [Harpy] who's threatening the Eslant while Pablo is trying to locate the monster cave."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You want to know the identity of the monster? Then I will need some more time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "For now go kill some [Harpys], they are so loud that its hard for me to concentrate.\n\nDefeat [Harpy] who's threatening the Eslant while Agatha is trying to locate the monster cave."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Done already? I still need more time, so go catch some more Harpys."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_1180
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Done already? I still need more time, so go catch some more Harpys."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_1181

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "This should take care of the [Harpys] right? Go find [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo to find out what the monster is!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "This should take care of the [Harpys] right? Go find [Eslant Wise Man]Agata to find out what the monster is!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You came at the right moment, I found out what it was. It's [Gredel], it is huge and dislikes noise. I'll give you a map to its location but first go to you [Captain] and discuss."
